# The original was saved after the copy was made: the question says so, and Recover opens the copy as a new document.
@recovery
@file "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD" "dear sir"
cmd Open
choose "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD"
type ", and madam"
autosave
@clock +60s
put "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD" "saved by someone else"
restart
expect recover "Quill found changes to LETTER.QLD that were not saved, from 25 Nov 2026 at 2:32 PM. LETTER.QLD has been saved since then; the copy will open as a new document." default Yes
answer recover
dump
